WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.270
Hazuki-kun.

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.060
You're sure about this, right?

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:09.570
If you want to end your contract 
with your Origin, I won't stop you.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.320
But you'll have to swear a vow.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.870
If nothing else, you'll have 
to forget about this world.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.200
This is a magical medicine.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.210
What's happened here, the people you met...

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.340
All of your memories will 
disappear like morning dew.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:30.660
That's what I want.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:34.580
I wanted to forget it all.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.270
This is the end.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:42.180
This is goodbye.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.940
Farewell, my magic.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:47.810
My fantasy world.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:50.760
My first...

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:26.980
<b>Episode 5:
Farewell, My Magic</b>

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:31.980
<b>GENk XMAS Edition
Need a date? Look inside!</b>

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:38.010
"Stop crying, Cinderella."

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.530
"I'll let you go to the ball."

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:46.270
The old witch waved her wand, 
and the pumpkin turned into a carriage,

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:51.340
and her old clothes turned 
into a pure white dress.

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:56.370
Hazuki, you can have this back.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.610
How was it?

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.610
This whole story would've ended in three pages

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.870
if the protagonist had just 
told her that he loved her.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.150
Just forget it...

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.910
More importantly...

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:12.880
<b>Christmas Dance Party</b>

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:12.880
<b>Reservations Required</b>

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:12.880
<b>Admission 1,000 yen    Drinks (Separate) 500 yen</b>

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.580
Premium night...

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.060
Christmas Dance Party!

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.880
Reservations required!

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:15.070
It's a Christmas party I'm running.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:17.290
Come with me.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.840
No way! No way!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:21.770
Why?

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:23.300
It's a Christmas party!

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.490
That's for people with social lives! Not me!

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:28.390
And I don't have anything to wear, 
so I'd want to go shopping,

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.270
but I don't have clothes 
to wear to go shopping!

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.690
A-And so...

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:37.190
I appreciate the offer, but I'll pass.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:41.030
Something happened 
with your boyfriend, right?

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.190
You've looked so glum. It's obvious.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.660
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:50.690
Listen, the best way to forget 
a man is with another man.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.120
Leave it to me.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.580
W-Wait!

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:59.760
Listen, words in a book 
are just words in a book.

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:01.970
Basically...

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:06.430
The books you're reading 
don't say a word about you!

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.270
And you've got the clothes, right?

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.310
You know, that blue dress.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.960
Good luck, Hazuki.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:20.230
She knows about the dress.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.590
<i>Mom's dress...</i>

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:33.350
Hazuki, find your own story.

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:45.800
<i>I'd convinced myself that I could 
find my own story in books.</i>

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:48.080
<i>But I was wrong.</i>

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.370
Thank you, Misa-san.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:10.580
This will prevent the loss 
of a valuable Origin.

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.260
Cinderella has been successfully sealed.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.070
Good work.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:22.920
Sorry to make you do something so unpleasant.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:23.960
No...

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.420
Shizuka-kun, how about some tea?

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:28.430
No, I...

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.810
I have something to discuss.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.560
Sit down and have some tea.

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:34.740
All right.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.520
You seem busy.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.640
I'm not...

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.260
But I'm busy.

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:44.490
Maybe I'll create another one with magic.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:48.570
Do you think you can win 
the qualifier tomorrow?

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:50.730
I'll win.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:54.660
How is the third fighter, Sadohara Mai-kun?

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:58.030
She's doing her best.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.630
Here I go!

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:02.740
The Grateful Crane!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.030
The Grateful Crane...

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:15.220
It can heal and strengthen comrades.

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:17.610
It's a powerful Origin.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.770
But nowhere near Cinderella.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:25.400
Don't worry.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:29.000
I will protect Sadohara-san.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.640
You okay, Shizuka?

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:33.010
There's no problem.

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.680
I'll win.

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.500
That's not what I meant.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.830
Hazuki thinks you hate her.

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:42.750
But you don't. Actually, 
it's because you're friends that...

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:43.760
It's okay.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:45.630
It's okay now.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:50.800
Kagimura-san has forgotten everything.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.650
But Shizuka, you...

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.790
Station Book Store

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.980
<b>Party Dancing 
For Dummies</b>

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.270
Dance for Beginners I

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:32.130
Kagimura Hazuki...

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:40.480
You didn't take the medicine, did you?

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:49.160
I'm not here to get angry.

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.090
Are you sure?

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:55.280
I might tell everybody 
about the world of magic.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.700
Nobody will believe you.

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:03.000
Erasing your memories 
isn't to protect those left behind.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.720
It's to help those who leave.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:07.710
If you're living in a new world,

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:10.320
it's best not to have 
the knowledge of the old.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.630
Then why...

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:18.760
Why are you here with me now?

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:24.790
<i>My story doesn't have a next page now.</i>

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.270
<i>It's all blank.</i>

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:31.240
<i>The story without an ending 
asks me what I'm going to do.</i>

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.440
There's a story I want you to hear.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.730
A story that I want you,

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:53.440
the one chosen by Cinderella 
and no one else, to hear.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:57.800
It happens at a Witchcraft School, 
and the protagonist is

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.780
a gentle Maedchen studying there.

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:07.070
She truly believed she could 
make someone happy with magic.

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:10.690
She even wanted to save 
the Stains and Flecks.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:16.530
But her wish was considered madness 
by the other Origin Masters.

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:25.710
That's why she only told her 
close friends about that dream.

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:32.590
Unfortunately, she was 
a very talented Maedchen.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:41.170
She was a natural pick for the Hexennacht,

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:44.060
and she fought and suppressed her 
own feelings in order to participate.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.620
If she won, her dream could come true.

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:51.630
She fought and fought, 
to make her silly dream come true.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:55.530
She defeated all her rivals 
and lead her team to victory.

00:09:56.120 --> 00:10:00.990
By that point, her heart must 
have already been broken.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:03.350
When everything was over,

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:07.430
she gave up on her contract 
with the Origin and vanished.

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:11.930
Her dream didn't come true?

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:14.610
I couldn't say. I've forgotten.

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:15.920
Forgotten?

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:19.800
I probably took the medicine 
that erases memories.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:25.990
Her name, her face, the days I spent 
with her, I can't remember them.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:29.650
But the excitement I felt 
when we first flew together,

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.500
or the feelings I felt when we shared 
our dreams on those nights...

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.400
Those remain.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:38.810
As well as the regret that 
I failed to notice her pain.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:43.290
I'm sorry. The story 
doesn't really have a conclusion.

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:47.410
This ends my story.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.320
<i>It feels like she's speaking through me,</i>

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:54.700
<i>to someone who she can't even remember.</i>

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.460
<i>It must be...</i>

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:57.420
That girl...

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.080
...must have been the 
Cinderella Origin Master, right?

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:01.180
Yes.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.490
Um...

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.400
Shizuka's team's match...

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:16.420
It's tomorrow.

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:19.030
December 25th at 4:00 PM.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:21.200
Don't worry.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.160
Tsuchimikado Shizuka is strong.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:27.110
If she can use her true power, 
she won't lose.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:38.780
At last, the day has come.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:43.500
To think a simple qualifier
 would take so much time and effort...

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:45.640
I appreciate your understanding.

00:11:46.170 --> 00:11:51.310
I'm told the Japanese school's 
leader is Tsuchimikado's successor.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.780
She's doing well.

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:59.040
I hope she doesn't repeat the failure 
that happened seven years ago.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:01.860
I'm sorry.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:06.490
Did you call the way she sacrificed 
her life for the school a "failure."

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:09.450
The loss of an Origin is 
a loss to the whole world.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.410
Make sure the Maedchen understand that.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:13.880
Of course.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:19.130
We've spent this much effort on them.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:24.270
If they were to lose to 
the ragtag Coalition team,

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:29.010
we would have to reconsider the entire 
management structure of the Japanese school.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.480
What do you mean?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.380
Hey.

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.530
What's your name?

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.200
Sadohara Mai...

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:48.680
I see.

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.950
I'll remember that, 
Miss Cinderella's Replacement.

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:54.420
You're...

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:01.700
Now, who will win and advance 
to the main tournament,

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.630
Japan or the Coalition?

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:05.280
Japan.

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:07.260
They have Tsuchimikado.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.430
I agree.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:12.550
The Moon Princess. The strongest 
and oldest of the Origins that still exist.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.650
Only three in the long history

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:18.260
of the Tsuchimikado have 
been able to attain it.

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:20.320
One of them is Shizuka.

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.320
But I don't know...

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.070
Qazan-san is strong.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.090
The way she overcame Lynn Davies...

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:30.370
She thinks I was using my full power then!

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:32.580
Silly girl.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.040
It's starting.

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:41.460
Now, this is a qualifier, but...

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:46.430
The whole world, including 
the Committee of 13, is watching.

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:49.180
And so, just like the main tournament,

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:52.890
the use of the Scriptures of the 
Earliest Ancestor has been allowed.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.850
The Scriptures of the Earliest Ancestor?

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.220
Now touch it, and say the word.

00:13:58.220 --> 00:13:59.470
Widmen!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.980
Ritual Magic: Hexennacht!

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.670
The oracle has been given.

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:19.920
This battle will be a castle seige.

00:14:20.510 --> 00:14:25.190
The first team to reach
 the castle will defend it.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:28.380
If they can protect it 
until the end, they win.

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:35.600
The next team must reach
 the throne at the center of the castle.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:40.170
If, after that, any of them remain 
at the time limit, they win.

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:40.190
Do you know what he's saying?

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:45.070
Victory can also be attained by wiping out 
the enemy team or their leader surrendering.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.240
Of course not.

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:48.190
Basically, race to the castle 
and give it your all to protect it.

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:56.000
Both teams, enter the magic 
circle if you're ready.

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.460
It's finally time.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.920
I'll make you regret what you did.

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:21.890
So that's it...

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.810
I-Is this the Land of Feast?

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:27.520
Yes.

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:29.740
A stadium made of magic.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:33.280
Both of you, enough talking.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:35.700
Do your Buchhülle immediately.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.170
Here I go!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.620
Little One Inch!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:41.970
Here I go!

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.080
The Grateful Crane!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:48.860
Let your power dwell within me! 
Moon Princess!

00:15:58.030 --> 00:15:58.810
Hazuki-san?

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.100
These are...

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:05.340
Misa said...

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:06.650
Quiet, Mom.

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:09.160
She told me about that dress.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:11.610
I wanted to go buy them with you,

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:14.450
but it was really sudden, right?

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:21.250
If it's all right, I'd like you 
to wear them with that dress.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:32.010
Aww, your makeup will come off.

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:36.900
Mom, after the glass slippers, 
we need a pumpkin carriage!

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:37.770
Right, right.

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:40.140
It's been outside the 
entrance this whole time.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.690
I can't go to the party, after all.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.070
I...

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.280
Do what you want.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.090
H-Hey, Mom.

00:16:58.090 --> 00:17:03.210
I could tell that something's been 
bothering you over the last month.

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:06.220
Club stuff? Or the boy you like?

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:10.590
Um...

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.320
You be quiet.

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.590
I'm a little relieved.

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:18.290
I don't want you to take this the wrong way,

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:22.960
but to be honest, I didn't really know 
what was going through your head.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.560
But I know how you feel now.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:29.020
It happened to Misa,

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:32.690
and I was your age once, too.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.060
Saeko-san...

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:36.320
Do what you want.

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.650
It's your life.

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.400
And your decision to make.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:44.790
But if you can't decide, 
you can always come talk to me.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:48.170
We're a family.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:54.300
I don't really get what's going on, 
but hang in there, Hazuki.

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:57.620
Thank you, S-Sis...

00:17:58.150 --> 00:17:59.260
Mom, too...

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:04.730
Where are you going?

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.270
Your dress!

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:13.650
<i>Stop crying, Cinderella.</i>

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:18.110
<i>I'd convinced myself that I could 
find my own story in books.</i>

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:22.280
<i>But I was wrong.</i>

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:32.040
You can't participate in the Hexennacht 
if you can't use Buchhülle.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.930
I'm not your friend.

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:43.220
How far will you run?

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:58.860
<i>I have to be the one to make my story.</i>

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.280
Maerchen!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.000
Maerchen! Maerchen!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:07.220
Maerchen!

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:10.330
This stupid thing...

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:15.460
I won't run, anymore. So please, open!

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:18.570
Let me go see Shizuka-chan!

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:24.430
Kagimura Hazuki, I've been 
waiting to hear those words.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:26.530
Hurry.

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:29.310
The ball's already begun.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.610
Shizuka-kun's team is in a different 
dimension, created by magic.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:43.630
Unfortunately, only those registered 
as part of the team can enter.

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:46.580
<b>Tsuchimikado Shizuka
Kato Ariko
Sadohara Mai
Kagimura Hazuki</b>

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:46.580
Oops!

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:52.540
Oh, dear. I forgot to take 
your name off the registration list.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:54.620
Headmistress...

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.820
This is all I can do for you.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:04.010
What are you doing, Tsuchimikado Shizuka?

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:08.630
Her underpowered helper 
is sure slowing her down.

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:10.890
<i>Lucky me.</i>

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.560
<i>If the Coalition makes it 
to the main tournament,</i>

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.690
<i>I can keep using Qazan as my pawn.</i>

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:22.660
Hazuki-kun, you can't use your Buchhülle,

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.970
and you don't even have your 
contract with your Origin anymore.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.380
It's very dangerous to go fight.

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:31.710
Will you go anyway?

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:33.550
I'm sure you will.

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:37.810
Unlike me, you're trying 
to create your own story,

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:40.450
without relying on this medicine.

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:42.420
Of course...

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:45.540
This stuff was just water.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:48.100
<i>I'm so scared... so scared... so scared...</i>

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:51.990
<i>I want to read a book!</i>

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:55.650
<i>I want to forget all this right now 
and immerse myself in a story!</i>

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.070
No!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.860
Why is she...

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:06.620
Who are you?

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:13.250
Shizuka!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:18.440
Give it back...

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.130
My...

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:06.950
It's me, Hazuki.

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:07.930
I'm the Headmistress.

00:23:07.930 --> 00:23:10.110
How old are you, Headmistress?

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:12.390
This year, I'll be age 40.

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:13.570
Huh? That's normal.

00:23:13.570 --> 00:23:17.490
Were you expecting me 
to say "I'm age 17 forever!"?

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:18.550
Well...

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:20.550
That's right! I'm almost 40!

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.690
I could have a kid your age because I'm 40!

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:26.140
I'm sorry!

00:23:26.140 --> 00:23:28.290
Next time: Cinderella Doesn't Look Back.

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Episode 6: 
Cinderella Doesn't Look Back.</b>

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:31.800
Kagimura Hazuki-kun, 
see me in my office later.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.270
<b>Illustration: Sueda Akihiro</b>
